SUMMARY:Lecture-Performance | HerCinema by Luísa Sequeira — Providence
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261013T180000
DTSTAMP:20261014T045844Z
UID:c346528e06bef9432b01254badc6@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Lectures\, Seminars and Workshops\,Providence\,
 United States
DESCRIPTION:Please join the Department of Portuguese and Brazilian Studies
  on Tuesday\, October 13 at 6:00 pm in the conference room of Meiklejohn H
 ouse (159 George St.) for a Lecture-Performance by Luísa Sequeira. This e
 vent is part of a Fall Film Series being hosted by the department\, Throug
 h Her Lens \, celebrating women creators in lusophone cinema. About the Pr
 esentation HerStory is a term coined by Robin Morgan to describe a histori
 cal narrative told from a feminist perspective. Drawing on this concept\, 
 HerCinema proposes a lecture/ performance in media res that uses archival 
 images\, reactivated to create a new cinematic narrative. It is a work in 
 progress\, in which a new draft is presented at each \nCategory: Lectures
 \, Seminars and Workshops\nOriginal listing: https://events.brown.edu/port
 uguese-brazilian/event/337706-lecture-performance-hercinema-by-lusa-sequei
 ra
LOCATION:Meiklejohn House\, Meiklejohn House
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://events.brown.edu/portuguese-brazilian/event/337706-lecture-per
 formance-hercinema-by-lusa-sequeira
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:brown-arts
END:VEVENT
