DESCRIPTION:Please join us on October 14 for a lunchtime book launch featu
 ring David Rain \, associate professor of geography and international affa
 irs and Department of Geography and Environment chair\, as he discusses hi
 s recently published book\, Mapping Urban Environmental Risks Using Open S
 ource GIS . Rain’s book serves as a practical guide to understanding and
  responding to environmental risks in cities using open-source geographic 
 information systems (GIS) and freely available spatial data. Wednesday\, O
 ctober 14 Agenda: 11:45 a.m. | Lunch Noon-1 p.m. | Book Presentation and
