STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/the-challenges-of-teaching-about-animal
 -activism-adjunct-teachers-in-animal-law
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:gwu-arts
END:VEVENT
