DESCRIPTION:Join CCAS Dean Paul Wahlbeck for a multifaceted panel discussi
 on on the ethical dilemmas surrounding AI\, the impact of its use on the
  wiring of our brain and ways faculty are now integrating AI into their t
 eaching and research. Participating in the conversation will be Professor
  of Political Science Sarah Binder \, Professor of Interior Architecture D
 ouglas Crawford \, Associate Professor of Cognitive Neuroscience Dwight Kr
 avitz and Associate Professor of Philosophy Tad Zawidzki . The entire GW c
 ommunity is invited to attend. Registration is encouraged but not required
 . Featured Panelists:\nCategory: Academic\nOriginal listing: https://calen
